<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">


<head>

    <%- include("../components/meta",{ title : "Privacy Policy - How PDF Versatile uses user's data" , description
        : "Privacy Policy for PDF Versatile - All in One PDF Tool. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal data including files, email, and cookies."
        , keywords : "Privacy Policy, PDF Versatile, PDF Tool, Data Protection, User Privacy" , og_url : "/privacy" ,
        robots : "index,follow" }) %>


        <meta property="og:image" content="https://pdfversatile.com/images/image-og.webp" />


        <link rel="canonical" href="https://pdfversatile.com/privacy" />

        <%- include("../components/metaCommanCSS") %>

            <%- include("../components/metaGA") %>

</head>


<body>

    <%- include("../components/header") %>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">

            <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">

                <!-- Heading -->
                <div class="text-justify md:text-center mb-12">
                    <h1 class="text-4xl text-gray-700 md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Explore our privacy policy for how PDF Versatile collects, uses,
                        and protects your data</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Intro -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Overview</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        At <strong>PDF Versatile</strong>, we value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we
                        collect,
                        use, and safeguard your personal information when you use our All-in-One PDF Tool platform.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Data Collection -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed mb-3">
                        We collect the following types of data to provide and improve our services:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                        <li><strong>Email Address & Password:</strong> For user authentication and account management.
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>IP Address:</strong> Used for security and rate limiting.</li>
                        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> Used for authentication and improving user experience.
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>Uploaded Files:</strong> Once the requested operation is completed, your uploaded files and any generated output are automatically deleted from our server.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Data Usage -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">How We Use Your Data</h2>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                        <li>To provide and maintain our PDF tools</li>
                        <li>To authenticate users securely</li>
                        <li>To process uploaded files</li>
                        <li>To improve performance and user experience</li>
                        <li>To prevent abuse using rate limiting</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Storage -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Data Storage & Security</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        Your data is stored on secure servers hosted on secure Droplets. We use efficient databases to
                        manage user data and uploaded files. We take appropriate measures to protect your
                        information from unauthorized access.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- File Handling -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">File Handling Policy</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        Files uploaded for PDF processing are stored temporarily on our server only for the duration required to complete the requested operation. Once the processing is successfully completed, all uploaded files and any generated temporary files are permanently deleted from our server. We do not retain or permanently store your uploaded files.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Cookies -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Cookies Policy</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        We use cookies to maintain login sessions and enhance user experience. These cookies are
                        essential
                        for the proper functioning of our website.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Third Party -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed mb-3">
                        We use third-party services to improve our platform:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                        <li>Google Analytics – for tracking and analyzing user behavior</li>
                        <li>Google Ads – for advertising and marketing purposes</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- User Rights -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">User Rights</h2>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                        <li>You can access your personal data at any time</li>
                        <li>You can delete your account and all associated data in one click</li>
                        <li>You can contact us for any privacy-related concerns</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Children -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Children's Information</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        Our platform is not restricted by age. However, we do not knowingly collect sensitive personal
                        information from children without appropriate consent.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Updates -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Policy Updates</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected on this page with
                        an updated date.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Contact -->
                <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:
                        <br><br>
                        <strong>Email:</strong>
                        <a href="mailto:support@pdfversatile.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">
                            support@pdfversatile.com
                        </a>
                    </p>
                </div>

            </section>

        </div>

        <%- include("../components/footer") %>

</body>

</html>